    "Road | Two-lane paved road behind car, running into distance | Visible behind woman and car side as camera pans | Consistent perspective with vanishing point",
    "Desert Landscape | Dry scrub brush and distant mountains in background | Background shifts left as camera pans right | Mountains and scrub maintain relative positions",
    "Camera | Starts front-quarter view of car | Pans right to side-quarter close-up | Geometrically compatible movement along the car's axis"
